{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"src/cli/commands/agents/pages/diff.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-01T20:16:44.473229Z","id":"8e89e55a9fa75234a2a761bac07a2099b487ce7536b770bac52c97f9eaf82c85","body":{"detail":"The example shows the closer inline on the row (`... (ce7d1a3c) — resolved by 8f790b7b: \"...\"`) and an `original: \"...\"` line under drifted rows. print_record_row (src/cli/commands/diff.rs:620-663) puts the summary and closer on separate indented continuation lines whenever there are extras, and print_drifted never prints an 'original:' line. Actual output: `- concern    src/a.rs:3  (1d2ccdeb)` / `to resolve` / `resolved by 9eb2b10a: \"done\"`. Agents told to parse or paste this output get a different shape.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":95},"end":{"line":115},"content_hash":"a0cc7bb55e3b6d9b3035854fefe9699d41bb2793c9facc9de3f0f3717b95795c"},"suggested_fix":"Regenerate the example from a real run (and consider a test that asserts the agents page example matches the format).","summary":"the documented human output of diff does not match what the command prints","tags":["review","review:2026-10-01","session:claude-code:906ddd45-2dc1-4a64-9674-56eec33bd6f1"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"src/cli/commands/agents/pages/show.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-01T20:16:44.473262Z","id":"b76c1e3667168fb7e4c60c52eee0563776236733640e32d295b1aaee9795369d","body":{"detail":"The page says 'The artifact argument is the subject name as stored in the .qual file (e.g., src/auth.rs)'. show.rs:40-41 maps the argument through targets::Locator::subject, so from src/ `qualifier show a.rs` shows src/a.rs (verified on 0.8.0), and `show src/a.rs` from src/ would look up src/src/a.rs. threads.md documents the CWD-relative rule correctly.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":77},"end":{"line":78},"content_hash":"6ec6ef3c65e92b0d01abeb70b736230fbacee23246c63ec95abbb8ff8866031c"},"suggested_fix":"Replace the bullet with: 'The artifact is a path relative to the current directory (subjects are stored relative to the project root); there is no wildcard matching.'","summary":"show.md says the artifact argument is the stored subject name, but show resolves it relative to the current directory","tags":["review","review:2026-10-01","session:claude-code:906ddd45-2dc1-4a64-9674-56eec33bd6f1"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"src/cli/commands/agents/pages/diff.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-01T20:18:47.299624Z","id":"5d3a7f54a9af9f46cb40afdfaf13aee5d15b93c1021fec6d8b5094805e0c1019","body":{"detail":"Real run: '  - blocker    src/a.rs:3  (c42800a8)' / '      same' / '      superseded by fc9b3a09: \"same\"' -- summary and closer on continuation lines, not inline as diff.md:102-103 shows. print_drifted (diff.rs:584-612) builds continuations only from span context; `grep -n original src/cli/commands/diff.rs` has no hits, so the 'original:' line at diff.md:107 is never printed.","kind":"comment","references":"8e89e55a9fa75234a2a761bac07a2099b487ce7536b770bac52c97f9eaf82c85","summary":"confirmed: diff.md's human output example does not match the real layout","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:906ddd45-2dc1-4a64-9674-56eec33bd6f1"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"src/cli/commands/agents/pages/show.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-01T20:18:47.299635Z","id":"4dc0ac4b3705bd3164c29d3d75cd5852cd241fc49207c99204b571793ed5af0d","body":{"detail":"From src/ in a scratch repo: `qualifier show a.rs` shows src/a.rs; `qualifier show src/a.rs` fails with 'No records found for 'src/src/a.rs''. show.md:77-78 says the argument is the subject as stored.","kind":"comment","references":"b76c1e3667168fb7e4c60c52eee0563776236733640e32d295b1aaee9795369d","summary":"confirmed: show resolves the artifact CWD-relative, not as the stored subject","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:906ddd45-2dc1-4a64-9674-56eec33bd6f1"]}}
